@smoke-test
  Scenario: Login fails with incorrect username  
    Given I open the KN login page  
    When I click the button "Mit Keycloak anmelden"  
    And I click the button "Fortfahren"  
    And I enter incorrect username  
    And I enter correct password  
    Then I should see an error message about invalid credentials  

